WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:03.136
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.937
We hope you're doing well,
and now if you don't mind

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:06.373
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:09.909
President Biden today declared
a major disaster in Florida,

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:14.647
and then Florida in turn
declared Biden a major disaster.

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.182
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.486
The White House released
a 44-page plan yesterday

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:20.619
to fight hunger.

00:00:20.619 --> 00:00:22.889
It's just
the Cheesecake Factory menu.

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:26.492
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.761
Before the government runs out
of money tomorrow,

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:31.731
Congress is reportedly
set to pass stopgap legislation

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:34.234
to keep the government funded
through 2 1/2 more months.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.769
Is it just me,
or is the government always

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:39.639
waiting until the last minute
to fund itself?

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:42.508
The federal government is like
a kid running for the school bus

00:00:42.508 --> 00:00:45.245
with one pant leg on
holding a waffle.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:50.249
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:53.085
Queen Elizabeth's death
certificate was released today

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:54.921
and said that
she died of old age,

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:57.924
a condition she battled
for nearly 30 years.

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.994
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.797
At a recent panel,
Texas Senator Ted Cruz

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:06.766
was booed by the crowd
after he said that

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.568
the best way
to stop school shootings

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:10.636
was to increase police presence
on campuses.

00:01:10.636 --> 00:01:12.839
Cruz hadn't been booed that bad

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:15.175
since the last time
he walked into his house.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:17.811
"Hey, family."

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:20.513
"Boo!"

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.581
Republican operatives
in Pennsylvania

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:24.750
are reportedly trying to push
the unfounded theory

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.286
that Democratic Senate candidate
and lieutenant governor

00:01:27.286 --> 00:01:29.588
John Fetterman
is affiliated with a gang.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:32.591
Even worse, they're trying to
push the unfounded theory

00:01:32.591 --> 00:01:35.428
that Dr. Oz is affiliated
with Pennsylvania.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.797
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:40.433
The Netflix reality dating show
"Love Is Blind"

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:42.568
is reportedly casting
for a new season

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.304
to be set in Washington, D.C.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:47.873
Said one contestant,
"Okay, so he's really quiet,

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:50.243
but an amazing listener."

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:53.312
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.312 --> 00:01:55.581
In a new interview,
Tom Hanks said that

00:01:55.581 --> 00:01:58.017
he made a ton of movies,
but added that he thinks

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.019
"four of them are pretty good,"

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:03.289
and then Vin Diesel said, "I've
also made a ton of movies."

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:07.459
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:10.697
Tom Hanks announced
in the same interview

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:12.965
that next year he will release
his debut novel,

00:02:12.965 --> 00:02:14.167
and no surprise here --

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.903
it's called
"World War II in Space."

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:19.072
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:23.510
Maybe a little surprise here.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:27.480
And finally the airline
Virgin Atlantic yesterday

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.283
unveiled its new
gender-neutral uniform policy.

00:02:30.283 --> 00:02:31.850
Flight attendants
can choose to wear

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.286
either pants, a skirt,

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.988
or the Chalamet.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:36.489
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.591
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

